# Final Note

Financial controls are not built on distrust.

They exist to protect:

- The community
- The team
- The House Manager
- The Board
- HQ
- The integrity of the Palestine House network

Strong controls make organisations:

- More resilient
- More trusted
- More fundable
- Better governed

Build them from the beginning.

Operate them consistently.

Allow them to become the invisible foundation that supports Palestine House's cultural mission.

