# Final Note

Reporting is an act of accountability.

Every KPI represents a commitment:

- To the community
- To the mission
- To good governance
- To financial sustainability

Every report provides evidence of whether those commitments are being fulfilled.

The purpose of reporting is not simply to inform HQ.

Its primary purpose is to help every Palestine House location understand its impact and continuously improve the way it serves the Palestinian community.

Build strong reporting systems from the first day.

Maintain them consistently.

Use the evidence they generate to make better decisions every year.

