The strongest beverage programmes ensure that:

- Ritual is documented.
- Craft is measurable.
- Equipment is maintained.
- Claims are accurate.
- Every cup reflects the values of Palestine House.

> **Protect the ritual.**
>
> **Respect the craft.**
>
> **Document the standard.**
>
