# THE EVENT PRODUCTION STANDARD

> Event Production SOPs are not bureaucracy. They are the discipline that makes excellent events possible.

Every intake form, approved budget, Front-of-House briefing, readiness check, debrief, and reset checklist is an act of care for the Palestinian community whose artists, stories, and cultural moments Palestine House is responsible for presenting with dignity and excellence.

The non-negotiables exist because shortcuts create crises.

The Duty Manager exists because someone must be accountable.

The debrief exists because improvement is a discipline, not an accident.

The reset exists because the next guest deserves the same experience as the first.

*Passion Inspires. Discipline Delivers.*

