## Guest Journey & Member Journey

*Palestine House Local Operations Playbook | 15 Risk Cards | 8 Lifecycle Stages*

---

## Risk Card Categories

* **COMMON MISTAKE**
* **RISK**
* **RED FLAG**
* **COMPLIANCE ISSUE**
* **ESCALATION TRIGGER**

> Each card identifies a specific risk or failure mode in Guest Journey and Member Journey operations.
>
> The journey only works when every stage is actively managed, from first discovery through to member advocacy.
>
> The **Escalate if** field defines when a situation must be referred to HQ. When in doubt, escalate. Palestine House would rather receive an unnecessary escalation than learn about a journey failure through a lost member or community complaint.

