# How to Use This Section

Review all 15 items:

- Before activating the first partnership
- During every quarterly Anchor Partner review
- When onboarding partnership-management staff
- Whenever a partnership concern arises

## Operating Requirements

- Assign a named owner to monitor partnership risks.
- Record active red flags and compliance concerns in the partnerships log on the same day they are identified.
- Report every activated escalation trigger to the House Director within the stated timeframe.
- Do not delay escalation while attempting to resolve a qualifying issue informally.

> Escalation timeframes are mandatory and apply without exception.

