# The Marketing Standard

Marketing at Palestine House is not about chasing numbers.

It exists so that the Palestinian community knows it has a cultural home—and so that the wider community understands, values and experiences Palestinian culture with authenticity and respect.

Every:

- Social media post
- Email
- Press release
- Event photograph
- Story
- Interview

is an opportunity to communicate Palestinian culture with dignity.

Approach every communication as though it is someone's very first experience of Palestine House.

Make it worthy of that moment.

