**Category:** Risk

### What it looks like

Different Palestine House locations launch the same campaign at different times.

Examples include:

- Early publication
- Delayed launch
- Missed sequencing

### Why it matters

Global campaigns depend on synchronised delivery.

Misalignment weakens:

- Network visibility
- Campaign momentum
- Message consistency

It may even create contradictory campaign narratives.

