## 06. Campaign Partnerships Agreed Without Political Screening

**Category:** Risk

### What it looks like

A local organisation offers to:

- Amplify the campaign
- Share content
- Collaborate publicly

The offer is accepted without vetting.

### Why it matters

Public campaign partnerships imply organisational endorsement.

If partners have political affiliations, Palestine House may appear politically aligned.

