# A FINAL WORD

The Palestine House brand represents more than a network of venues. It represents the dignity, excellence, and cultural vitality of Palestinian identity on a global stage.

When you uphold the brand standards, you are upholding that statement. When you let standards slip, you are diminishing it—however unintentionally.

HQ provides the standards and the tools. You are responsible for the delivery.

When in doubt, ask. When something is wrong, fix it. When something new is needed, submit it for approval.

***Passion Inspires. Discipline Delivers.***
