# Lifecycle Stage

This guide applies from the moment a Partner Agreement is activated.

| Stage | Requirement |
|------:|-------------|
| **Steps 1–3** | Pre-Launch |
| **Steps 4–6** | Complete before Soft Launch |
| **Steps 7–9** | Ongoing during Live Operations |
| **Step 10** | Continuous obligation from Day 1 |

