# Step 4 — Launch Digital Communications

Every communication reflects the Palestine House brand.

All communication systems require HQ approval before use.

---

## Email Platform

Confirm:

- Approved provider
- HQ template
- Sender identity
- Working unsubscribe process
- GDPR-compliant opt-in

---

## Social Media

Configure:

- Approved account names
- Approved branding
- HQ-approved biographies

Use organisational—not personal—accounts.

---

## Community Messaging

If WhatsApp or similar tools are used:

