# Step 5 — Implement Data Protection

Technology creates legal and ethical responsibilities.

Every location handling personal data must comply with applicable privacy legislation.

---

## Privacy Notice

Publish a clear Privacy Notice explaining:

- Data collected
- Purpose
- Retention
- Individual rights

---

## Consent Records

Maintain explicit marketing consent within the CRM.

Consent must be actively given.

---

## Data Minimisation

Collect only information genuinely required.

Avoid collecting unnecessary fields.

---

## Access Controls

Restrict access using role-based permissions.

Never share personal information without lawful authority.

---

## Breach Response

Maintain a documented process covering:

- Detection
- Containment
- Investigation
- Notification

---

> **Important**
>
> Where GDPR or equivalent legislation applies, additional legal obligations may exist.
>
> Obtain local legal advice where required.

---

## Expected Output

- [ ] Privacy Notice published
- [ ] Consent records maintained
- [ ] Data minimisation applied
- [ ] Role-based access implemented
- [ ] Breach procedure documented

---

# Step 6 — Integrate the Technology Stack

