| **5** | Review Submission Quality | House Manager | Before every submission |
| **6** | Maintain Version Control | KMS Owner | Within 10 working days of HQ updates |
| **7** | Conduct Annual Library Review | House Manager | Annually |
| **8** | Contribute New Templates | House Manager | Ongoing and during annual review |

---

# Final Note

The Palestine House Template Library is the operational backbone of the network.

Every completed template represents:

- Better governance
- Stronger accountability
- Reliable reporting
- Shared operational knowledge

A disciplined template system allows every House to benefit from the experience of every other House.

Use the library consistently.

Maintain it carefully.

Improve it continuously.

Share what works.

